OL,3,GNEWSAHome of oldest restaurant given to
OL,4,ANational Trust
OL,5,
OL,6,FRules restaurant will continue to
OL,7,Ftrade, while becoming a commercial
OL,8,Ftenant of the charity. Under the deal,
OL,9,Fthe rent payments will go towards
OL,10,Fconserving the building.
